{"path":"/fashion-icons-timeless-style-inspirations/","kind":"post","bodyClass":"wp-singular post-template-default single single-post postid-71 single-format-standard wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-anvogue theme-anvogue woocommerce-no-js eio-default pls-wrapper-full pls-theme-skin-light pls-no-sidebar pls-widget-default pls-widget-toggle pls-widget-menu-toggle pls-product-hover-mobile pls-slider-navigation-mobile pls-product-image-radio3x4 pls-mobile-canvas-sidebar pls-slider-nav-circle elementor-default elementor-kit-8","headerClass":"pls-site-header pls-header-2 pls-header-icon-2 header-sticky pls-header-overlay header-color-dark","title":"Fashion Icons: Timeless Style Inspirations &#8211; Poudre Beauty","main":"<main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pls-site-content\">\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full \" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1.jpg 1920w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-500x333.jpg 500w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-800x533.jpg 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-480x320.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-960x640.jpg 960w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pls-site-container container\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row \">\r\n\r\n<div id=\"primary\" class=\"pls-content-area col-md-12\">\n\n<article id=\"post-71\" class=\"single-post-page has-post-thumbnail  post-71 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-fashion tag-women\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"entry-post\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n<div class=\"entry-category\">\t\n\t<span class=\"cat-links\"> <a href=\"/category/fashion/\" rel=\"category tag\">Fashion</a> </span>\n</div><h1 class=\"entry-title\">Fashion Icons: Timeless Style Inspirations</h1><div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"author-link vcard\">\n\t\t\t\t\tby\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/author/jeanclaude/\" rel=\"author\">Jean Claude</a>\t\t\t\t</span> \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/fashion-icons-timeless-style-inspirations/ \">Apr 17, 2024</a>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n</div>\t\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\t\n\t<div class=\"entry-thumbnail-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"entry-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\t\t\n\t\n\t\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The poblano yogurt is a key component here, but I totally understand if you want to skip out on it because of time, lack of poblanos, or you&#8217;re anti-chile. No problem, just about any flavor-forward yogurt slather will do in its place. You could simply crush a clove of garlic into some paste with a pinch of salt, and stir that in your favorite plain yogurt &#8211; also delicious. Or, whisk a tablespoon of harissa paste into your yogurt.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I’ve always been passionate about underwear and shapewear and have a huge collection from over the years! When it came to shapewear, I could never find exactly what I was looking for and I would cut up pieces and sew them together to create the style and compression I needed.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://anvogue.presslayouts.com/dummy/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1370\"/></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://anvogue.presslayouts.com/dummy/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/blog-1-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1370\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How did SKIMS start?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is such a hard question! Honestly, every time we drop a new collection I get obsessed with it. The pieces that have been my go-tos though are some of our simplest styles that we launched with. I wear our Fits Everybody Thong every single day – it is the only underwear I have now, it’s so comfortable and stretchy and light enough that you can wear anything over it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For bras, I love our Cotton Jersey Scoop Bralette – it’s lined with this amazing power mesh so you get great support and is so comfy I can sleep in it. I also love our Seamless Sculpt Bodysuit – it’s the perfect all in one sculpting, shaping and smoothing shapewear piece with different levels of support woven throughout.</p>\n\t\n</div><!-- .entry-content -->\t</div>\n\t\n\t</div>\t\t\n</article>\n\n\t<div class=\"tag-social-share\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-tags\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pls-tags-title\">Tags:</span>\n\t\t\t\t <a href=\"/tag/women/\" rel=\"tag\">Women</a>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pls-social icons-theme-colour icons-shape-circle icons-size-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"pls-social-title\">Share:</span>\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=/fashion-icons-timeless-style-inspirations/\" rel=\"external\" class=\"social-facebook\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"picon-facebook-f\"></i> <span class=\"social-text\">Facebook</span></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=/fashion-icons-timeless-style-inspirations/&amp;title=Fashion+Icons%3A+Timeless+Style+Inspirations\" rel=\"external\" class=\"social-linkedin\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" ta